'' A MODULE'S OVERLOAD OF A HEADER'S NAME IS IN THE IMPORTER'S SET (RFC-0001 F4): qo overloads
'' windows.bi's GetWindowText (declared with an ALIAS), GetWindowRect (declared plainly) and
'' GetWindowText again at the API's own arity. main reaches each bare and as 'qo.', and
'' Windows' own declarations still answer their calls; qb, a module importing qo, reaches
'' them bare too. Linked and run: the importer names the symbols qo defined.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/ovjoin/libs tests/modules/src/ovjoin/app/main.tiko -o tests/modules/ovjoin-main.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' ENV: TIKO_INCLUDE=toolchains/tiko-windows/inc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/ovjoin-main.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: qo:text0 -7 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: qo:text0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -7
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5 qo:into
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  6 qo:into
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: qo:text0+qo:text0
